													},
													"name": "06 · Evaluation strategies",
													"documentation": "At build time the Expression compiles its RPN tokens into a CompiledExpression (opcodes, constants, variable slots). With EvaluationStrategy.BYTECODE, BytecodeCompiler translates it into a hidden class (java.lang.classfile) implementing Program; otherwise, or where classes cannot be defined at runtime, the CompiledExpression interprets itself. Both compute built-ins with Builtins, the single implementation also behind BuiltinFunction and BuiltinOperator.",
