												"$ref": "RXhwNGpNAAAAAAkL"
											},
											"name": "CompiledExpression",
											"documentation": "Immutable, allocation-light program compiled from an RPN token array. Built-in operators and functions are evaluated through Builtins with their operands taken straight from the stack, instead of virtual apply(double...) calls, which avoids the varargs array allocation and the megamorphic call per token. Variables are read from a slot array instead of a java.util.HashMap. Custom operators and functions fall back to their apply(double...) implementation.",
											"isLeaf": true,
											"attributes": [
