												"$ref": "RXhwNGpNAAAAAAkL"
											},
											"name": "Expression",
											"documentation": "A parsed and compiled expression, created by ExpressionBuilder#build(). Set the variables with #setVariable(String, double), then call #evaluate() as often as needed. The expression is compiled once, when it is built, according to the EvaluationStrategy selected on the builder: interpreted by default, or as generated JVM bytecode. An instance holds mutable variable values and must not be modified by several threads at once. Give each thread its own copy with #Expression(Expression); copies share the parsed tokens and the compiled program.",
