											"name": "01 · Class overview",
											"documentation": "The whole library at a glance, members hidden. ExpressionBuilder turns a string into an Expression (Tokenizer + ShuntingYard). The Expression compiles its RPN tokens into a Program - interpreted (CompiledExpression) or generated bytecode (BytecodeCompiler) - whose built-ins are computed by Builtins.",
